es, Puerto Rico, and District of Columbia; 3: 100% FPG annual $27,320; 130% FPG annual $35,516, monthly $2,960, weekly $683; 150% FPG annual $40,980, monthly $3,415, weekly $789. These are published reference values, not a state-specific limit or eligibility determination.","mapping_status":"not_mapped","requirement_id":"income_table_3"},{"source_id":"usda.fna.senior-food","statement":"2026 CSFP table for 48 contiguous states, Puerto Rico, and District of Columbia; 4: 100% FPG annual $33,000; 130% FPG annual $42,900, monthly $3,575, weekly $825; 150% FPG annual $49,500, monthly $4,125, weekly $952. These are published reference values, not a state-specific limit or eligibility determination.","mapping_status":"not_mapped","requirement_id":"income_table_4"},{"source_id":"usda.fna.senior-food","statement":"2026 CSFP table for 48 contiguous states, Puerto Rico, and District of Columbia; 5: 100% FPG annual $38,680; 130% FPG annual $50,284, monthly $4,191, weekly $967; 150% FPG annual $58,020, monthly $4,835, weekly $1,116. These are published reference values, not a state-specific limit or eligibility determination.","mapping_status":"not_mapped","requirement_id":"income_table_5"},{"source_id":"usda.fna.senior-food","statement":"2026 CSFP table for 48 contiguous states, Puerto Rico, and District of Columbia; 6: 100% FPG annual $44,360; 130% FPG annual $57,668, monthly $4,806, weekly $1,109; 150% FPG annual $66,540, monthly $5,545, weekly $1,280. These are published reference values, not a state-specific limit or eligibility determination.","mapping_status":"not_mapped","requirement_id":"income_table_6"},{"source_id":"usda.fna.senior-food","statement":"2026 CSFP table for 48 contiguous states, Puerto Rico, and District of Columbia; 7: 100% FPG annual $50,040; 130% FPG annual $65,052, monthly $5,421, weekly $1,251; 150% FPG annual $75,060, monthly $6,255, weekly $1,444. These are published reference values, not a state-specific limit or eligibility determination.","mappin