equires facts or compound semantics unavailable in the reviewed typed profile; retained as unresolved."},{"citation":{"excerpt":"Child Support Forms","locator":"html.visible_text","source_id":"missouri.dss.temporary-assistance","source_url":"https://dss.mo.gov/temporary-assistance/apply","retrieved_at":"2026-11-13T23:27:19.661314Z","source_version":"sha256:7810731801f3a08c317a3b2892cd30aa7556b7c8cd742dcfd58f2f1feee8d39f","source_record_id":"source-page-63ef48e56e04eb5ad105","source_content_sha256":"7810731801f3a08c317a3b2892cd30aa7556b7c8cd742dcfd58f2f1feee8d39f","source_visible_text_sha256":"6985487725bf502e4c8b423359419cc600a04a9df6439dec894237a87c73f980"},"statement":"Child Support Forms","mapping_status":"not_mapped","requirement_id":"codex-s7-13","requirement_type":"application","unresolved_reason":"Requires facts or compound semantics unavailable in the reviewed typed profile; retained as unresolved."},{"citation":{"excerpt":"The Family Support Division will process your application and any supporting documentation as soon as they receive it. This can take up to 10 days . Once your application is processed, you will get a letter that lets you know if you are eligible for TA benefits or not.","locator":"html.visible_text","source_id":"missouri.dss.temporary-assistance","source_url":"https://dss.mo.gov/temporary-assistance/apply","retrieved_at":"2026-11-13T23:27:19.661314Z","source_version":"sha256:7810731801f3a08c317a3b2892cd30aa7556b7c8cd742dcfd58f2f1feee8d39f","source_record_id":"source-page-63ef48e56e04eb5ad105","source_content_sha256":"7810731801f3a08c317a3b2892cd30aa7556b7c8cd742dcfd58f2f1feee8d39f","source_visible_text_sha256":"6985487725bf502e4c8b423359419cc600a04a9df6439dec894237a87c73f980"},"statement":"The Family Support Division will process your application and any supporting documentation as soon as they receive it. This can take up to 10 days . Once your application is processed, you will get a letter that lets you know if you are eligible for TA benefits or not.","mapping_status":"not_mapped","requirement_id":"codex-s7-14","requirement_type":"application","unresolved_reason":"Requires facts or compound semantics unavailable in the reviewed typed profile; retained as unresolved."},{"citation":{"excerpt":"If you are approved for TA, your first benefit will either be loaded to your EBT card or will be sent by direct deposit to your bank account within 45 days. After that, you will get your benefit monthly . The amount your household will get will depend on a few factors, including the size of your household and your current expenses related to caring for your children.","locator":"html.visible_text","source_id":"missouri.dss.temporary-assistance","source_url":"https://dss.mo.gov/temporary-assistance/apply","retrieved_at":"2026-11-13T23:27:19.661314Z","source_version":"sha256:7810731801f3a08c317a3b2892cd30aa7556b7c8cd742dcfd58f2f1feee8d39f","source_record_id":"source-page-63ef48e56e04eb5ad105","source_content_sha256":"7810731801f3a08c317a3b2892cd30aa7556b7c8cd742dcfd58f2f1feee8d39f","source_visible_text_sha256":"6985487725bf502e4c8b423359419cc600a04a9df6439dec894237a87c73f980"},"statement":"If you are approved for TA, your first benefit will either be loaded to your EBT card or will be sent by direct deposit to your bank account within 45 days. After that, you will get your benefit monthly . The amount your household will get will depend on a few factors, including the size of your household and your current expenses related to caring for your children.","mapping_status":"not_mapped","requirement_id":"codex-s7-15","requirement_type":"availability","unresolved_reason":"Requires facts or compound semantics unavailable in the reviewed typed profile; retained as unresolved."}],"compiled_rules":[{"citation":{"excerpt":"Live in Missouri","locator":"html.visible_text","source_id":"missouri.dss.temporary-assistance","source_url":"https://dss.mo.gov/temporary-assistance/apply","retrieved_at":"2026-11-13T23:27:19.661314Z